{#- The one-workspace flow, drawn simply (founder, 2026-11-26): chat with the
    model and/or the team; spin up a project; tasks and workflows (from a chat
    or a project); reports and dashboards (from a chat or a project, tied to
    the tasks and workflows or standalone). Outcome Services is a separate
    layer with its own environment and its own flow of the same components:
    the main workspace can work with it, but it does not feed back into the
    line, so the map draws no arrows to or from it (founder, 2026-11-26). The
    steps under the map explain each one; keep the two in step. Outcome
    Services is NOT built yet: the box says so. -#}
{%- macro ico(d) -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="{{ d }}"/></svg>{%- endmacro -%}
<figure class="ent-map" aria-label="The workspace flows from chat to project, then to tasks and workflows, then to reports and dashboards. Outcome Services is a separate layer with its own chats, projects, tasks, workflows, reports and dashboards.">
  <ol class="ent-map-row" role="list">
    <li><span class="ent-map-k">1</span><span class="ent-map-i">{{ ico("M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z") }}</span><b>Chat</b></li>
    <li><span class="ent-map-k">2</span><span class="ent-map-i">{{ ico("M3 7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2 2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z") }}</span><b>Project</b></li>
    <li><span class="ent-map-k ent-map-k--pair">3</span><span class="ent-map-i">{{ ico("m4 7 2 2 3-3M4 17l2 2 3-3M13 8h7M13 18h7") }}</span><b>Tasks</b></li>
    <li><span class="ent-map-i">{{ ico("M4 12a8 8 0 0 1 14-5.3M20 12a8 8 0 0 1-14 5.3M18 3v4h-4M6 21v-4h4") }}</span><b>Workflows</b></li>
    <li><span class="ent-map-k ent-map-k--pair">4</span><span class="ent-map-i">{{ ico("M14 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9zM14 3v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h5") }}</span><b>Reports</b></li>
    <li><span class="ent-map-i">{{ ico("M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20H2") }}</span><b>Dashboards</b></li>
  </ol>
  <div class="ent-map-os">
    <div class="ent-map-oh"><span class="ent-map-k">5</span><b>Outcome Services</b><span class="ent-map-sub">Its own environment</span><em>Under construction</em></div>
    <ul class="ent-map-chips" role="list"><li>Chat</li><li>Project</li><li>Tasks</li><li>Workflows</li><li>Reports</li><li>Dashboards</li></ul>
  </div>
</figure>
